SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu 10
    Ba 5

RATES
Calcite_kin
-start
10  sa = PARM(1)
20  k = PARM(2)
30  rate = k * sa
40  moles = rate * TIME
50  SAVE moles
-end

KINETICS 1
    Calcite_kin
        -formula CaCO3 1
        -m0 1.0
        -parms 1.0 10.0
        -steps 100 in 10 steps
END
